<title>USA: Simon DeBartolo Group unsecured debt priced.</title>
<headline>Simon DeBartolo Group unsecured debt priced.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group Inc said Simon DeBartolo Group LP had priced a new issue of $250 million of 10-year senior unsecured notes maturing November 15, 2006.</p>
<p>The notes pay interest semi-annually at 6.875 percent. The transaction is expected to close on November 26.</p>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group Inc, a real estate investment trust, is a general partner and owner of a controlling 61.5 percent interest in Simon DeBartolo Group LP.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering will be used to retire the mortgages on two existing properties and to reduce debt.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
